  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced></math> is a variable point in the complex plane such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ιm</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>z</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of the perimeter of the locus of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced></math> is</p>\r\r<p>(use&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>14</mn></math>)</p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "12.56",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ιm</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math><br />Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math>, then<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence, locus is a circle<br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> radius of circle is <math><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> perimeter of circle is <math><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
